  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Income Housing Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Soluciones Habitacionales Inters Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WOULD CONSIST OF TWO COMPONENTS: (I) AN INVESTMENT COMPONENT ORIENTED TO THE FINANCING OF NEIGHBORHOOD UPGRADING AND NEW HOUSING; AND (II) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING COMPONENT TO SUPPORT THE EFFORTS TO RATIONALIZE HOUSING POLICIES AND INSTITUIONS WORKING IN THE SECTOR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
